---
import lightSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/nine-hypotheses-commitment-light.svg?raw';
import darkSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/nine-hypotheses-commitment-dark.svg?raw';
import Chart from './Chart.astro';
---

<Chart
  lightSvg={lightSvg}
  darkSvg={darkSvg}
  title="About a quarter of the epics finished while nine in ten open issues were marked High"
  caption="Epic completion over the trailing 12 months, against the priority mix of open engineering issues."
>
  Two bars on a zero to 100 percent scale. 27.7 percent of the roughly 480 epics opened in the trailing 12 months were finished. 89.4 percent of open engineering issues were marked High priority.
</Chart>
